#: src/EDITOR/EDITOR.cpp src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgid "table.gCampaignWinTexts.0"
msgstr "Gateway has fallen!  The other lords have abandoned their castles and fled.  They have alerted their homelands and now gather their forces.  Speed is of the essence."

#: src/EDITOR/EDITOR.cpp src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgid "table.gCampaignWinTexts.1"
msgstr "The Archipelago of the Ancients has been subdued and added to your domain.  On the horizon lies a vast, unexplored - and hostile - continent."

#: src/EDITOR/EDITOR.cpp src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgid "table.gCampaignWinTexts.2"
msgstr "The healing power of the Eye of Goros spreads throughout the land.  The population unites behind you and the other lords retreat.  The war for domination begins."

#: src/EDITOR/EDITOR.cpp src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgid "table.gCampaignWinTexts.3"
msgstr "With your victory, the other lords have made their final retreat.  They must each in turn be fought one-on-one in their homelands, and their personal castles must be captured."

#: src/EDITOR/EDITOR.cpp src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgid "table.gCampaignWinTexts.4"
msgstr "The knights are broken in battle!  You have conquered their homeland."

#: src/EDITOR/EDITOR.cpp src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgid "table.gCampaignWinTexts.5"
msgstr "The barbarian castle has been overthrown and their army scattered!"

#: src/EDITOR/EDITOR.cpp src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgid "table.gCampaignWinTexts.6"
msgstr "You have burst through the forest maze and destroyed Lamanda's castle."

#: src/EDITOR/EDITOR.cpp src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgid "table.gCampaignWinTexts.7"
msgstr "You have followed the gargoyles to the castle of Lord Alamar and have shattered the might of the warlocks."

#: src/EDITOR/EDITOR.cpp src/SOURCE/KB.cpp
msgid "table.gCampaignWinTexts.8"
msgstr "The dragons join your cause and the competing warlords capitulate.  You now rule a vast and united land as the one true King!"

