msgstr "Use a 19200 baud connection speed.\n\nNote: In general, computers with the older UART 8250 chip should use 19200 baud, and computers with the newer UART 16550 chip should use 38400 baud.  When in doubt, try slower speeds first, and if they work, then try faster speeds.  Most computers made in 1994 or later have a UART 16550 chip."

